

-> Storing Files – DB vs File System
    | Feature     | File System | Database (BLOB)   |
    | ----------- | ----------- | ----------------- |
    | Performance | ✅ Fast      | ❌ Slower          |
    | Large files | ✅ Best      | ❌ Not recommended |
    | Backup      | Manual      | Automatic         |
